ledge  of pressure points enabling him to take  down opponents with a single strike and  is known to unleash a bone rattling  flying kick Which packs an unbelievable  amount of force behind it like Captain  America he's said to represent the peak  of human strength power and Agility he  does however boast one skill specific to  only the most skilled of martial artists  one that raises his abilities to a level  slightly Beyond those of fellow  non-powered Heroes Shang Chi has the  ability to focus his Qi the spiritual  energy or life force inherent to all  living things in Real World Martial Arts  this practice is used mainly in  meditation and as a way of controlling  one's fear and anger and the Marvel  Universe the ability can be honed into a  weapon and shangshi uses it to augment  his skills to devastating effect he can  temporarily boost his strength and  endurance Beyond even Peak human levels  Dodge or deflect bullets and control his  body's reaction to poison or drugs  because of these abilities and his utter  Mastery of an array of deadly fighting  styles shangshi is often considered to  be the greatest unarmed combatant in the  entire Marvel Universe he was deemed by  no less an authority than black panther  to be an even more formidable fighter  than the super-powered Iron Fist his  Mastery over his Chi has even received a  technological boost at times he uses a  special pair of nunchucks designed by  Tony Stark which can accumulate and  disperse Shang Chi's spiritual energy  unleashing deadly concussive blasts  Shang Chi's interactions with other  Marvel heroes has been frequent but one  of his Wilder team-ups was with an  unlikely band of new york-based Heroes  it started with an investigation into  the bizarre Slaughter of an entire  faction of Brooklyn mafia members  Daredevil discovered it was the work of  eulik a rock troll hailing from asgard's  Underworld who had come to Earth in  search of a mystical horn Daredevil  Enlisted the aid of Shang Chi Black  Widow a cloakless dagger and The  Punisher to form the Marvel Knights and  deal with eulik and his minions  afterwards the rest of the group became  determined to bring the Punisher whose  methods they found to be unsavory to  Justice they were joined in this  dangerous Endeavor by Moon Knight but  the revamped group's efforts were  interrupted by cloak who was in the  psychological clutches of the demon  Nightmare and was on a misguided Rampage  to consume all evildoers after consuming  The Punisher Daredevil Black Widow and  Moon Knight cloak was halted by Doctor  Strange whom dagger had brought in to  assist before things got truly out of  hand by the end of the series The  Punisher was still punishing away Shang  Chi has occasionally been called upon to  train other heroes in hand-to-hand  combat including your friendly  neighborhood wall crawler during the  Revenge of the Spider Slayer story arc  Spider-Man realized that the villain  Alistair Smythe had found a way to imbue  his Spider Slayer robots with a version  of his Spider Sense he created a device  to disrupt the ability but was forced to  set it off manually deactivating his own  Spider Sense in the process this caused  some difficulty in the subsequent spider  Island event during which thousands of  Heroes villains and ordinary citizens  alike developed spider powers on the  recommendation of Madam Webb Spidey went  to Shang Chi for training he created a  completely new martial arts style  intended to complement Spider-Man's  Powers which he called The Way of the  spider Spider-Man became an even more  dangerous fighter than he already was  using his Newfound martial arts prowess  to take down opponents as powerful and  skilled as Spider-Woman and even Shang  Chi himself  Shang Chi has at times been imparted  with superhuman abilities during the  aforementioned spider Island event he  was one of the many temporarily granted  the same Powers as Spider-Man a scary  notion if ever there was one he used  these powers to help dispatch the threat  of the spider-powered super villains  running roughshod over New York City in  another incident Shang Chi was  dispatched with other Avengers to the  fictional island of madrapore to deal  with an ancient dragon which had been  awakened from its Slumber underneath the  island using Pym particles Shang Chi  enlarged himself to match the dragon's  godzilla-like stature and promptly  defeated it in combat in a more recent  incident shangshi volunteered to  investigate the city of Kobe Japan after  it was struck with the evolution  speeding origin Bomb by the Godlike  entity known as ex-nilio While others  had been absorbed by the Genesis matter  which was a byproduct of the bombing  shangshi was able to commune with it and  in the process gained the ability to  produce an unknown number of duplicates  of himself each one with the original's  memories and abilities it's unknown  whether he still possesses this power  back in 2006 when Marvel first announced  its intentions to start Marvel Studios  and produce a slate of films featuring  some of its lesser-known characters  virtually no one was thinking that the  Endeavor would result in the single  highest grossing film franchise of all  time  Avengers  assembled the rights to Marvel's most  famous properties namely Spider-Man and  the X-Men were held by Sony and fox  respectively both of which had created  successful film franchises Marvel seemed  to be coming late to the party with a  stable of characters that included in  the order they were announced Captain  America The Avengers Nick Fury black  panther Ant-Man Cloak and Dagger Dr  Strange Hawkeye power pack and Shang Chi  Marvel Studios would of course go on to  elevate many of these properties to  household name status although some took  considerably longer to develop than  others Ant-Man took a full nine years to  reach the big screen and the pre-teen  power pack have yet to get its time in  the spotlight but finally well over a  decade after the fact Shang Chi stands  poised to join the MCU thanks in part to  another solo vehicle which became one of  Marvel's biggest success stories and one  of the biggest films of 2018. black  panther astonished audiences crafted  mainly by African-American filmmakers  and featuring a hero who is the king of  the technologically advanced African  nation of Honda this never gets ordered  the film proved that big budget  Blockbusters created from a specific  cultural Viewpoint can resonate strongly  with General audiences and it even  outgrossed the Juggernaut that was  Avengers Infinity War at the domestic  box office taking a cue from this  success Marvel appears to have gone all  in on diversity and it's likely the  studios hope that Shang Chi and the  legend of the ten rings can strike a  similar chord in pop culture at large to  this end the production has been loaded  up with talented people of Asian descent  on both sides of the camera Japanese  irish-american Destin Daniel [ __ ] will  direct from a screenplay by  chinese-american scribe Dave Callahan  who is contributing to Warner Brothers  upcoming Wonder Woman 1984 as well as  Sony Pictures animations as yet Untitled  sequel to Spider-Man into the  spider-verse Chinese Canadian actor simu  Liu has landed the title role and the  suddenly ubiquitous rapper turned actor  Aquafina will appear Among The  Supporting Cast legendary Chinese actor  Tony Leong will Star as the Mandarin an  iconic villain who many fans feel was  previously given extremely short shrift  the title of shangshi's solo vehicle  quickly got the attention of Marvel fans  eluding as it does to a mysterious  terrorist organization that has lurked  in the shadows of the MCU since its  Inception the ten rings are the group  responsible for Tony Stark's kidnapping  in Iron Man they've been alluded to in  both of that film sequels as well as  Ant-Man they're led by none other than  the real Mandarin who famously wears a  ring on every finger in the comics this  is not the phony Trevor Slattery or his  Handler Aldrich Killian both of whom  falsely laid claim to the Mandarin name  but he's not here he's here but he's not  here he's in Shang Chi and the legend of  the ten Rings this group will finally  step out of the shadows and truly make  their presence felt the ten rings are  dedicated to nothing less than the  destabilization of the entire planet  sowing the kind of chaos which will lead  to the collapse of world governments and  create a power vacuum they've butted  heads with Iron Man Black Widow and Nick  Fury but they'll soon face the Master of  Kung Fu who never met a challenge that  he couldn't kick the absolute crap out  of  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more Looper videos about  your favorite things are coming soon  subscribe to our YouTube channel and hit  the Bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]
 

